cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use DevMap-CHD, please cite this dataset release and the originating
  source publications/resources represented in sources/source_manifest.tsv.
title: DevMap-CHD
type: dataset
version: "2026.09.08"
authors:
  - family-names: Taylor
    given-names: Deanne M.
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3302-4610
    affiliation: Children's Hospital of Philadelphia; University of Pennsylvania Perelman School of Medicine
repository-code: https://github.com/TaylorResearchLab/DevMap-CHD
url: https://github.com/TaylorResearchLab/DevMap-CHD
license: CC0-1.0
abstract: >-
  DevMap-CHD is a versioned, source-resolved registry of genes reported or
  curated in congenital heart disease resources. The 8 September 2026 baseline
  contains 662 current-HGNC genes drawn from 6 unique source groups represented
  through 14 provenance-preserving membership sets, with reproducible identifier normalization.
keywords:
  - congenital heart disease
  - CHD
  - gene registry
  - provenance
  - HGNC
  - DevMap
